:"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. August to September and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025, November to December finished at 48% of normal on the middle of the grids, and May to June hit 181%. Grid 15162 had its driest year in 1952 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
